# Who reviews what.
#
# Gated paths control the AWS side of the app (the Lambda service, its OpenTofu infrastructure, and
# the tooling that deploys them). With branch protection on `main` and "Require review from Code
# Owners" enabled, a change to any line below cannot merge without a dev-team approval — which is the
# only gate a non-technical author cannot route around locally.
#
# Replace @jordan-advone with the dev-team handle if the team is ever a GitHub team slug.
# Unlisted paths are the open zone: unassignDrivers.html, translations/, docs/, README.md.

*                       @jordan-advone

/infra/                 @jordan-advone
